From 50e936982397939701fe7a5422729aa6793662c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:57:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 14/15] fix: load compressed templates for generated
 capabilities

Share template opening between text substitution and XML generation so USE_ZLIB deployments continue to work with compressed templates alone.

Fixes: b3028a5c57d9 ("feat: expose camera imaging through optional control helpers")
Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
---
